# Site publish (fucksvinland)

Do **not** build/upload to Render or GitHub Releases unless the user explicitly asks (e.g. «выложи на сайт», «апдейт на сайт», «publish»).

Local fixes: edit `app/` + test via `run.bat`. Leave `VERSION.txt` / site alone until asked.

When the user **does** ask to publish:

1. Bump `VERSION.txt`
2. `python build_exe.py` (builds + `publish_release.py` → GitHub + Render `/api/publish`)
3. Verify `https://fucksvinland.onrender.com/api/version`
